# Benchmark: contains on 300 numeric items
# Workload: build a list of 300 numbers, then 20 lookups of the LAST item (the
# worst case: every element is compared). Measures equality-driven list scans.
# The list build is included; see docs/OTTER_1_0_PERFORMANCE_BASELINE.md for the
# build-only cost.

numbers are empty
count from 1 to 300 as n
    add n to numbers
.

hits is 0
repeat 20 times
    if numbers contains 300
        hits is hits plus 1
    .
.
say "contains 300" hits
